" and arrives when its day appears. If a move is too long to arrive in "
"time, the dates pause briefly. With the “By duration” or “Sync to music” "
"rhythm, that time is taken from the dates: the video keeps the requested "
"duration. With “By rate”, it is added to the displayed duration."

